### Register a new customer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "phone": "+8801712345678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Get profile (replace TOKEN with the value returned from /login)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Update profile
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane A. Doe",
  "phone": "+8801799999999"
}

### Add address
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/addresses
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Home",
  "street": "12 Green Road",
  "city": "Dhaka",
  "state": "Dhaka Division",
  "zipCode": "1215",
  "country": "Bangladesh",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Get addresses
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/addresses
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Update an address (replace ADDRESS_ID)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/users/addresses/ADDRESS_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Home",
  "street": "12 Green Road, Apt 4B",
  "city": "Dhaka",
  "state": "Dhaka Division",
  "zipCode": "1215",
  "country": "Bangladesh",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Delete an address (replace ADDRESS_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/users/addresses/ADDRESS_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Internal lookup (used by Order/Delivery services, replace USER_ID)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/internal/USER_ID
